Hi there, I am a researcher based at James Cook University in Townsville Australia. I came across your package as I am scoping options to analyse coral SNP data. In short, I have sperm samples from all potential fathers of a mass coral spawning event, and would like to trace the "success" of each father across a time series of developing coral larvae. I am following the vignette for your package, and have gotten stuck at the inspect() stage. The command runs without error, but comes back with a non-sensical result; that 0/549 samples are "sampled" and all samples have 100% missing data. Curious if you can help me troubleshoot. I look forward to hearing from you! Warmest regards, Hillary

